This licence covers the code and written notes in this repository.

It does not and cannot grant any rights over the games these tools analyse.
No cartridge data is included here, in any form: not ROM images, not patches
carrying original bytes, and not artwork or music decoded out of one. Supply
your own dumps.

tools/sign7800.py is a port of Bruce Tomlin sign7800.c (2004), itself a
hand-decompilation of an Atari program; the algorithm and key material are
his published work and are reproduced here under the same understanding they
have circulated in the 7800 community for twenty years.
